# Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env.
# Claude needs nothing here: it is signed in with your plan. Every line below is optional (docs/SETUP.md says what
# happens without each). Placeholders only: your own values go in .env, never in this file.
GROK_WEBHOOK_URL=""
GROK_WEBHOOK_KEY=""
# Grok Bot's inbox repository is a setting, not a key: grok_inbox_repo in config/settings.local.json (docs/SETUP.md).
JEV_API_KEY=""
# No OpenAI key ever belongs here or anywhere else: ChatGPT is reached by plan login only.
# OPENAI_API_KEY and CODEX_API_KEY never belong here: the router refuses to run while either is set.
